---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Network from '../components/Network.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
---
<Base title="Kubernautic | Agentic AI for Kubernetes Operations" description="Discover AI-assisted Kubernetes operations: observe signals, investigate incidents, review explainable recommendations, and keep humans in control.">
  <section class="hero shell">
    <div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> INTRODUCING KUBERNAUTIC <span class="eyebrow-badge">AI-NATIVE OPERATIONS</span></div><h1>Meet the new<br/>intelligence behind<br/><span class="gradient-text">Kubernetes.</span></h1><p class="hero-lede">AI-powered insight. Governed action. Human control. A smarter way to understand and operate your cloud-native world.</p><div class="button-group"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/platform/">Explore the Platform <span>↗</span></a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/console/">Preview the Console <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-footnote"><span class="live-dot"></span> BUILT FOR PLATFORM ENGINEERS, SREs &amp; OPERATORS</div></div>
    <Network />
    <div class="hero-scroll">SCROLL TO EXPLORE <span>↓</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="trust-strip"><div class="shell trust-inner"><span>BUILT ON OPEN FOUNDATIONS</span><div class="trust-labels"><span>KUBERNETES</span><span>OPENKUBES</span><span>GITOPS</span><span>OPEN OBSERVABILITY</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="section shell audience-section" id="for-teams" aria-labelledby="audience-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR EVERY LAYER OF OPERATIONS</span>
      <h2 id="audience-title">Clarity for leaders.<br/><em>Control for engineers.</em></h2>
      <p>From platform strategy to incident investigation, Kubernautic is being designed around the people responsible for keeping Kubernetes understandable, reliable, and accountable.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="audience-grid">
      <article class="audience-card">
        <div class="audience-meta"><span>01 / IT LEADERSHIP</span><span aria-hidden="true">◇</span></div>
        <h3>For CIOs &amp; CTOs</h3>
        <p>Understand operational risk, governance boundaries, and where AI-assisted operations may help your teams scale with confidence.</p>
        <a href="/enterprise/" class="text-link">Explore enterprise approach <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="audience-card">
        <div class="audience-meta"><span>02 / RELIABILITY</span><span aria-hidden="true">◎</span></div>
        <h3>For SREs &amp; Platform Teams</h3>
        <p>Move from disconnected alerts to incident context, evidence, and explainable recommendations — with the operator in control.</p>
        <a href="/agentic-ai/" class="text-link">Explore the operations loop <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="audience-card">
        <div class="audience-meta"><span>03 / BUILDERS</span><span aria-hidden="true">⌘</span></div>
        <h3>For DevOps Engineers</h3>
        <p>Discover the Kubernetes-native approach, inspect the planned read-only console, and explore OK Local in the OpenKubes ecosystem.</p>
        <a href="/open-source/" class="text-link">Explore OpenKubes &amp; OK Local <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="audience-disclaimer">Console preview is being prepared. Production deployments are evaluated individually; this section describes the intended experience.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section shell" id="how-it-works"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">01 / THE INTELLIGENT LOOP</span><h2>From noise to <em>knowledge.</em><br/>From knowledge to control.</h2><p>Kubernetes generates signals. Kubernautic turns those signals into context, recommendations, and accountable next steps.</p></div><div class="process-grid"><article class="process-card"><div class="card-no">01 <span>↗</span></div><div class="mini-visual visual-observe"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><h3>Observe.</h3><p>Bring cluster signals, logs, events, and platform state together in one coherent view.</p></article><article class="process-card"><div class="card-no">02 <span>↗</span></div><div class="mini-visual visual-reason"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>✳</b></div><h3>Reason.</h3><p>Correlate symptoms and context to help operators understand what matters.</p></article><article class="process-card"><div class="card-no">03 <span>↗</span></div><div class="mini-visual visual-recommend"><span>✓</span><span>→</span><span>◇</span></div><h3>Recommend.</h3><p>Surface explainable next steps instead of opaque, one-click magic.</p></article><article class="process-card"><div class="card-no">04 <span>↗</span></div><div class="mini-visual visual-govern"><span>◎</span><span>LOCKED BY POLICY</span></div><h3>Govern.</h3><p>Keep control with explicit approvals, defined boundaries, and traceable decisions.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="section dark-section"><div class="shell split-section"><div><span class="eyebrow">02 / THE PRODUCT EXPERIENCE</span><h2>An operations console<br/>built for <em>clarity.</em></h2><p>Not another wall of dashboards. A place where teams can discover issues, inspect evidence, and understand intelligent recommendations.</p><a class="text-link" href="/console/">See the Console Preview <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="console-mock"><div class="mock-toolbar"><span class="mock-brand">◈ kubernautic / console</span><span class="mock-status">● READ-ONLY PREVIEW</span></div><div class="mock-body"><div class="mock-side"><span>◉</span><span>▤</span><span>⌁</span><span>◇</span></div><div class="mock-content"><div class="mock-heading"><div><small>OVERVIEW / DEMO ENVIRONMENT</small><h3>Operations intelligence</h3></div><span class="mock-pill">DEMO</span></div><div class="mock-metrics"><div><small>WORKLOADS</small><strong>24</strong><span>↗ Healthy overview</span></div><div><small>ACTIVE SIGNALS</small><strong>03</strong><span>● Needs attention</span></div><div><small>AI INSIGHTS</small><strong>08</strong><span>✳ Ready to inspect</span></div></div><div class="mock-insight"><div class="mock-insight-top"><span>✳ AI-ASSISTED ANALYSIS</span><small>EXAMPLE SCENARIO</small></div><h4>Workload restart pattern detected</h4><p>Repeated container restarts correlate with a configuration update in the demo environment.</p><div class="mock-confidence"><span>RECOMMENDATION AVAILABLE</span><span>EXECUTION DISABLED</span></div></div><div class="mock-lower"><span>◷ Timeline &amp; evidence</span><span>◇ Policy guardrails active</span></div></div></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section shell"><div class="section-heading narrow"><span class="eyebrow">03 / ARCHITECTURE BY PRINCIPLE</span><h2>Powerful intelligence.<br/><em>Explicit boundaries.</em></h2><p>Designed around open integration, operator visibility, and the principle that AI recommends while humans remain in control.</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><article><div class="feature-icon">⌘</div><h3>Kubernetes-native</h3><p>A cloud-native operations story grounded in the Kubernetes ecosystem.</p></article><article><div class="feature-icon">✳</div><h3>AI-assisted diagnosis</h3><p>Understand incidents through correlated signals and evidence-backed explanations.</p></article><article><div class="feature-icon">◇</div><h3>Policy-aware by design</h3><p>Human review and explicit guardrails are first-class architectural principles.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="section ecosystem-section"><div class="shell ecosystem-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">04 / PART OF AN OPEN ECOSYSTEM</span><h2>Explore the foundations.<br/><em>Build on open.</em></h2><p>Kubernautic is connected to the OpenKubes ecosystem. Want to explore the platform from your own machine? Discover OK Local at OpenKubes.</p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://openkubes.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore OK Local on OpenKubes.org <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="ecosystem-graphic"><div class="ecosystem-center">OPEN<span>KUBES</span><small>OPEN PLATFORM ECOSYSTEM</small></div><div class="ecosystem-ring ring-a"></div><div class="ecosystem-ring ring-b"></div><span class="e-node en-a">LOCAL</span><span class="e-node en-b">CLOUD</span><span class="e-node en-c">EDGE</span></div></div></section>
  <CTA />
</Base>
